        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Prolonged anorexia and may require Relay toxicity arising from the consumption supplemental feeding to maintain caloric of animals poisoned with bromethalin may intake. occur.",
          "pdf_page": 1290,
